# Default deny: nothing is tracked unless it is named at the bottom of this file.
# Add a file here in the same commit that adds it, so that a stray note, a build
# product or a machine-local file can never slip into the history.
*
!*/

# Trees that are never walked, whatever they contain: large, machine-local, or
# generated. They stay ignored even though directories are otherwise traversable.
.library/
.local/
.repo/
.metaform/
engine/target/
dist/
research/lean/.lake/
research/exp/lean_oracle/
__pycache__/

# Products of the tracked code, and local configuration it generates.
*.pdf
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.png
engine/last-test.log
research/lean/last-check.log
scripts/local.ps1

# Inputs and notes that are not deliverables. 2.md needs no edit here: the
# default deny already covers it; the line is kept as documentation of intent.
1.md
1-digest.md
2.md
reasoning_engine_research_map.md
HANDOFF.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The tracked tree. One line per file; adding a file means adding a line.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
